===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{lb|en|of acts}} Done without consideration for [[morality]] or [[immorality]].
#* {{quote-book|en|author=w:Robert M. Sapolsky|title=w:Determined: A Science of Life Without Free Will|year=2023|publisher=Penguin|location=New York|isbn=978-0-525-56097-5|passage=If free will is a myth, and our actions are the mere '''amoral''' outcome of biological luck for which we are not responsible, why not just run amok?}}
# {{lb|en|of people}} Not [[believing]] in or [[caring]] for [[morality]] and [[immorality]].

